WEBVTT

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:10.340
I don't understand. Why are you crying when I saved you?

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.270
You didn't save me.

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:55.230
"Contract of Determination"

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:52.770
I didn't realize a black dragon was connected to Fang...

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:55.280
Is the pursuit force ready yet?

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:57.770
The organization is taking some time.

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:05.430
Ryuji-kun.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.750
We're going to save Rose.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:10.630
But we're up against a black dragon.

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.980
There's no way we can beat him.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.410
That hurt.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:41.700
You shouldn't be able to move yet. You've got quite the spirit.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:46.050
I like how you look when you're angry, princess.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.230
I am Rose!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.100
It's medicine. Drink it.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.280
Did you have me kidnapped?

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:05.180
Yes. You were defeneseless.

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.600
What would you have done if you were captured by humans?

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.280
You were watching me?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:13.770
The red dragon's barrier was too strong for me to enter.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.700
What do you want from me?

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:17.920
I want you to be my bride.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:25.510
This is the mark of engagement passed down by generations of black dragons.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.430
I don't need this!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.880
This has the power of contract.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.610
I am the only one who can remove it.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:32.530
Its location...

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.480
They got me.

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:36.660
Kai.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.410
Yes.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.960
It's a tracking device.

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:44.960
Prepare for an attack.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.290
Right away.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.350
Onyx.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:52.660
Why do you want to make me your bride?

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.450
I wish to become engaged.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:55.750
Engaged?

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.070
It's a ceremony to awaken the true powers of a dragon.

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:02.720
Only those who truly trust each other can perform it.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:07.280
Because of that, the power gained is overwhelming.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:11.250
You are already strong. Why do you want more power?

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.720
To make all the Lost Preciouses in the world mine.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:18.140
It's a dragon's nature. Don't you understand?

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.840
I only want one thing.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.010
I have no intention of becoming engaged to you.

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:24.170
Let me go!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:27.430
I'm sure you'll grow into a good woman.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.920
Come to my castle.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.440
No one will bother us there.

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.320
We can take our time getting to know each other.

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:34.880
No!

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.460
You're just going to let things be?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.150
You're going to let Rose go?

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:50.010
Eriko-san, you were ready to leave Rose with the society.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.570
How is this any different?

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:53.670
It's completely different.

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:56.460
Rose saved us.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:05:00.610
Don't tell me you don't understand why Rose chose to follow Onyx.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.530
She did it to protect us.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.480
She did it to save your life.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.270
But...

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.000
Doesn't your chest hurt?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.190
It's because Rose is gone.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:13.330
That's not...

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:16.970
Think about Rose one more time.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.030
Am I going to die?

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:33.560
But this egg...

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:47.850
I can't breathe...

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:51.310
Dad, Mom...

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.790
Ryuji!

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:57.210
That time, I...

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:01.420
was saved by Rose.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.540
I will bring Rose back.

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.580
I want to save her!

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.070
It's decided.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:17.490
To be honest, if you weren't coming, we wouldn't be able to rescue Rose.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.580
Do you have a plan?

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.410
Where did you get the access code?

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:26.420
I asked your mother.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:31.610
There are S Class Lost Preciouses in here.

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:35.530
They're high class items beyond my reach.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:38.280
Some of them are cursed.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.810
Are you afraid of losing control again?

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.620
To be honest, yes.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:45.140
I don't blame you given your first contact.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:54.070
Do you remember the slash breath you used during your response test when you were seven?

00:06:54.070 --> 00:06:54.870
Open it.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.320
You want me to do it?

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:58.060
Only you can open it.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:02.980
Your parents registered the Lost Precious with the society for your exclusive use.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.270
My parents...

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:09.080
They really pushed for that condition.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:12.970
I think they donated most of the other Lost Preciouses they gathered.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:15.310
Why would they do that?

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:18.600
I couldn't get it to respond at all.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:22.330
Maybe they believed you would be able to use it.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:26.690
A slash breath is made from dragon's teeth.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:30.560
We'll have to use this to fight the black dragon.

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:35.520
I don't know what sort of power is hidden in it, but why don't you give it another try.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.130
That's right...

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.150
Ryuji!

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:57.040
Ryuji!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:02.810
The reason Rose knew my name...

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:06.300
was because my parents came to rescue me.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:17.410
You have to awaken the treasure sleeping inside the sword.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.360
Concentrate.

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:30.510
I want to thank her for saving me.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.160
I want to apologize for hurting her.

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:39.300
I want to see her again.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.660
Please give me strength!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.010
Ryuji-kun, you did it.

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:58.800
Yes.

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:01.930
Understood. We'll be right there.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.190
Ryuji...

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:07.590
Ryuji!

00:09:14.690 --> 00:09:16.840
Ryuji! Ryuji!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:23.840
Impressive. The mist won't work on you any more.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:26.340
I'm going back to Ryuji!

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:28.280
I don't need anyone other than Ryuji!

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.250
Then I'll kill him.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:33.910
Die!

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.820
If you really love him, why don't you take his head with you?

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:49.320
Please don't kill Ryuji...

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.020
Forget about him.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:54.260
A human and a dragon can never be together.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.250
They're biased against everyone who isn't like them.

00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:00.420
Ryuji isn't like that!

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:01.560
Well then...

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:05.070
Then has he told you he adores you?

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:06.500
That he loves you?

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:10.280
Humans hate dragons.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:11.350
Why?

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:15.000
Because we have the power to destroy the world.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.420
They're afraid of us.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.760
That's a lie! Ryuji and Eriko were kind!

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:23.680
But didn't they take you to the society?

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:28.210
They didn't want to keep you.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.000
You were a nuisance.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.320
A nuisance...

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.770
You'll give up on him, won't you?

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.740
Otherwise, I'm going to kill him now.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.250
I'll give up.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.250
Onyx-sama.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:52.070
What appears to be a society helicopter is approaching.

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:54.640
They're here.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.860
Visual confirmation of the location of the final signal.

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:06.530
The new Tokyo multipurpose radio tower.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.530
Our mission is the recovery of the test subject.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.040
We won't be able to look after you.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:16.510
Don't worry about us. We're going to save Rose.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:19.340
Now, now. Let's play nice.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:22.240
Aren't you the one in the most danger?

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:25.240
This is a golden opportunity for research.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.020
Instrument malfunction, instrument malfunction.

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:31.080
We cannot approach the radio tower.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.620
There's an unidentified magnetic field in the area.

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:39.100
It's a dragon's barrier. They must still be inside.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.660
Entering from the sky will be difficult.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:47.780
Let's land and enter from below...

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.320
Hey!

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:10.450
Instruments functioning normally. The magnetic field has disappeared.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.440
Ryuji-kun, that was amazing!

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:17.210
It wasn't me. When I thought I had to save Rose, this thing...

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.730
There's no one else inside this tower?

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:29.030
The exterior is complete, but it'll be a while until it's open to the public.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:32.090
It must have made an excellent temporary hideout.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:34.130
Sound detecting sensor.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:34.840
Yes, sir.

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.120
What?

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:44.330
Fire!

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:48.230
Look.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:03.170
Ryuji-kun!

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:11.870
That was a close one.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:14.460
That thing must be a dragon's scale.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.630
When did you get here?

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:19.900
I can feel it.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.610
There's a strong presence inside the tower.

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:27.060
It could be Rose or Onyx or...

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:29.010
That's handy.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.940
You're getting the hang of it.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:41.720
I've been thinking...

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:44.470
Maybe Rose is attached to you because...

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.840
Oh, you mean the imprinting?

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.040
Not that. Maybe it's love at first sight.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.180
What?

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:56.110
Maybe she came here because she fell in love with you and wanted to see you?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.680
That's impossible.

00:13:57.680 --> 00:14:00.560
Dragons aren't such emotional creatures.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.750
Are you certain they aren't after seeing Rose?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.340
It's here.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.630
Rose!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.690
Ryuji!

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.350
What is Kai doing?

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.520
What are you doing?

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:32.740
Setting the mood for our engagement, I guess.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.410
I didn't realize dragons had such customs.

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:36.750
Let Rose go!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.080
Fine, fine.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:44.510
You'll have to tell them yourself.

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:48.240
Rose...

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.490
Stay back!

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:53.370
Ryuji, go home with Eriko...

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:55.630
What's wrong?

00:14:55.630 --> 00:14:58.710
Forget about me! Just leave me alone!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:14:59.890
Rose...

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:05.670
You heard her. You don't see us anything more than test subjects.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:11.180
We see you as no more than inferior beings.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:14.700
Dragons should be with dragons.

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:18.210
Make it clear to them.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:25.010
I didn't know humans don't like dragons.

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.220
I hate humans.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.080
I hate Ryuji.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.730
I hate you, I hate you, I hate you!

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:46.510
But I like you.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:52.520
I love you.

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.320
I love you, too!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:03.610
Ryuji, I love you, I love you, I love you!

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:06.120
I love, love, love you!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.750
I love you!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.200
What the hell is this?

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:12.420
No!

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:18.930
Why you...!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:20.280
Genmu, Hyosetsu!

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:23.100
What?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:24.870
Rose!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.060
Ryuji!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:31.730
Ryuji.

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.460
Eriko-san!

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:43.880
Protect Rose!

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:48.340
Don't touch my bride.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:51.500
Your bride?

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:54.380
That necklace is the symbol of our engagement.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.060
It's okay.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.640
You think you can remove it with that sword?

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:12.510
Your engagement is dissolved.

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:15.520
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.190
It won't work.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:21.480
No!

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:22.890
Rose, do it!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:23.660
Okay!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:30.180
There's still some strength left in you!

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.210
I'm taking this back.

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:48.750
Princess, please reconsider.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.750
I don't want to kill you.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:55.890
A human and a dragon can never be together!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:58.330
You'll never be happy!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:01.170
We're destined to fight and kill each other!

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:03.910
That has nothing to do with me!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.430
I love Ryuji!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:09.370
Good bye, princess.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.190
A dragon...

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:46.230
Ryuji-kun, run!

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:51.660
Senzaki-san!

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:54.820
Senzaki-san!

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.300
What should I do? What should I...

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.510
What is this?

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.170
Engage.

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:56.490
Ryuji!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.340
Ryuji!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.380
Ryuji-kun!

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.550
Ryuji! Ryuji!

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:11.510
Am I going to die?

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.140
Ryuji!

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:16.370
Ryuji-kun!

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:20.080
There's something I want to tell her...

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:38.370
Dragon's breath heals humans.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:39.890
Are you sure you don't need to record this??

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.270
Safe.

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:45.510
Out.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:54.100
I'm a driver in name only.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:57.410
You haven't done anything. It's the least you can do.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:59.090
I love you.

00:20:59.930 --> 00:21:01.110
I love you.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.850
Rose, that's enough.

00:21:03.850 --> 00:21:06.840
Ryuji, I'm getting off here.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:07.770
What?

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:11.280
If you stay with me, Onyx will come back.

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:12.510
He might.

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:16.020
There's no body, and I can't imagine that killed him...

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.880
I'll only cause you trouble.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:22.050
You're right. He might come back.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.290
That's why I'll become even stronger...

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.120
so I can be by your side.

00:21:30.550 --> 00:21:32.500
I want to stay by your side.

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:33.900
You're not a nuisance.

00:21:35.010 --> 00:21:36.230
Will you stay with me?

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:37.820
Yes!

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:40.610
Ryuji, I love you!

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.110
I love you!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.400
I love, love, love you!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:48.790
I love, love, love you!

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:47.430
I can't take any more of this.

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:53.500
How are we going to explain that?

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:39.960
Next episode "Beauty on the Beach"

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:28.970
Hello! This is Eriko back from America.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:33.000
It's not too strange these days, but foreign countries are very different.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.810
Their thinking, their customs...

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:36.350
It was an informative experience.

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.010
But the thing that made the biggest impact is...

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:39.960
a secret.
